  (text "Host must advertise at least 1.5 A: 300 mA shared downstream design budget.\nExternal J2 must advertise 3 A: 2 A total / 500 mA per port, subject to the power-report conditions.\nA default-current host requires qualified external power. Source changes cause re-enumeration."
