  (text "291 physical components placed; 4-layer bench board. No tracks or vias.\nSeparate GND1 / GND2 shield frames. TI HV land gap: 8.20 mm nominal; other barrier rules: 8.30 mm.\nStart with docs/revc/README.md for power limits, routing priorities, EEPROM and pending hardware tests."
